	quest.25870E8CC2E334CE.quest_desc: [
		"The Combiner is used to combine two different items into one. It can be used to increase the production efficiency of some recipes."
		""
		"It can also harness Bucks to create a feedback loop that gives more resources than were put in. See below for a step by step guide on how to do this for ores."
		""
		"1. Obtain an ore."
		"2. Combine the ore with a Buck."
		"3. Marvel at how our economical system has provided our Research and Development department with enough resources to make this breakthrough in technology."
		"4. Profit."
	]
	quest.25870E8CC2E334CE.title: "Not an Alloy Furnace"
	quest.2629D60C6A554FC6.quest_desc: [
		"The Combiner can make use of the Drill Bit to remove the impurities and leave you with pure, if inert, Opolisite. Unfortunately, this process does break the Drill Bit."
		""
		"That Combiner machine is really something, right? So versatile! It's almost as if the people who made this couldn't get anything else that could do this sort of thing without getting a whole other suite of machines that wouldn't have worked because it was too late in the development process so they just stuck with what they had......."
		""
		"No, we're sure the Combiner was just so perfect that nothing else was needed."
	]
	quest.2629D60C6A554FC6.title: "Inert Opolisite"
	quest.26CCB6BB3F25B1E3.quest_desc: ["Smelted netherrack makes brick which can be crafted into bricks"]
