	quest.44A8AB696ACEFB7E.quest_desc: [
		"Enriching an Opolisite Ingot causes it to self-mold into a cutting edge circuit board. This self-molding process has prompted research into whether the metal possesses some kind of sentience. Regardless of the validity of this theory, some evidence suggests that it does not feel pain."
		""
		"If you hear it talking to you, rest assured that whatever horrifying things you hear, it is merely a hallucination and not the souls of the dead crying out for release from their torturous existence."
