	quest.52C537BA60A677EC.quest_desc: ["The N0C-1URN Gene causes crops to be able to grow in near complete darkness. Grants more efficiency than SP-33-D."]
	quest.52CF54F3DCD72C37.quest_desc: ["Lumium is an alloy made from Tin, Silver and Glowstone."]
	quest.533245D62420E3DB.quest_desc: [
		"Your buyers only need so much of a product. The more you sell to them, the less they'll pay per unit. You'll have to be patient to get the most out of your work."
		""
		"If our data is reliable (and it is), buyers increase items per buck every 3 orders completed within the last minute. The increases become more severe the more orders you complete. But, if you leave it for a while, they'll come back down to the original price."
		""
		"Curiously, they don't seem to realise that the products are coming from the same place when you set more than one Market up. Ha, stupid consumers!"
	]
	quest.533245D62420E3DB.title: "A Demanding Market"
	quest.53F8B40C941FC8CB.title: "Sand"
	quest.53FDB9DE4F6CB449.title: "Lead"
	quest.543877730E13111D.quest_desc: ["Thermal Evaporation Towers can be used to extract salts from water. They can be powered either by an external heater or by placing Advanced Solar Generators on top. The former option is much more powerful but also requires power."]
