	quest.5ADB352273F0C693.quest_desc: ["The smoker, blast furnace and cartography table can all be used to trade with villagers to get the passport fragment"]
	quest.5ADB352273F0C693.title: "Villagers 1"
	quest.5AFC8EEC82811670.quest_desc: ["The H0-T Gene allows crops to grow in normally inhospitable conditions."]
	quest.5B88183D35AD44B2.quest_desc: ["Can be made in the solidifier"]
	quest.5BB9B3155055D3FA.title: "Into the Void"
	quest.5C173B390D5ABF73.quest_desc: ["Can be sold in the market"]
	quest.5C4358BF7407F058.title: "Unbreakable Advanced Storage License"
	quest.5D3C1FDF64D28615.quest_desc: ["Has a 50% chance to drop from hostile &lEnd and Boss mobs&r killed with a &lNetherite Sword&r"]
	quest.5D886B2003A6B859.quest_desc: ["A stable, physical version of the roots that hold the space-time continuum together. Can be used in certain ways to anchor and link machinery to the frabic of reality itself."]
	quest.5DB1D5850ED8A5EC.quest_desc: ["Turn your Demon Core into Fissile Fuel and process it in a Fission Reactor. Be careful not to explode!"]
	quest.5E7094CB0AAC52F9.title: "Beef"
	quest.5ECE41228D2F51B3.title: "Unbreakable Elite Farming License"
	quest.5F45E628D17FC782.quest_desc: ["Data is worth a lot, but not so much when it's really old. These records are from a very long time ago, when the digital age was just beginning, so little of it is in any way relevant to us today, but they can be very useful in feeding Reality Seeds the information it needs."]
	quest.5F45E628D17FC782.title: "Records of a Time Long Gone"
	quest.5FAA4DE6910A5A97.title: "Aluminum"
	quest.60491D15759948F8.quest_desc: ["The Nitro-temporal Lattice is a superconductive supercapacitor made from Nitro Crystals. It contains enough energy to light up a city and can be used as ultra high capacity power storage for incredibly advanced electronics."]
	quest.60491D15759948F8.quest_subtitle: "Watch out Duracell"
	quest.60491D15759948F8.title: "Nitro-temporal Lattices"
	quest.608564EED1D7F8A6.quest_desc: ["Can be sold in the market"]
	quest.624F98184110E692.quest_desc: ["passive mob drops"]
	quest.626436D997AB6156.quest_desc: ["Made from mixing Liquid Null and D-T Fuel."]
	quest.62A7A7BFEC1B76E4.quest_desc: ["Can be made in the solidifier"]
	quest.62C0C4EDB0EFDFDE.quest_desc: ["casting mixer"]
	quest.63904903E13CF813.quest_desc: ["Radiation Relief TM can be bought using Elite Power Bucks and can be used to remove radiation from the environment. Simply right-click it and the evidence of your nuclear disaster will be erased. But we still know what happened, and we'll be taking it out of your bonus."]
	quest.63904903E13CF813.title: "Radioactive Repercussions"
	quest.63FAAC4C04566B95.title: "Visit the Trial Chambers"
	quest.65154440ACAA424D.title: "Steel"
	quest.65291C12EFE0DE7B.quest_desc: ["Activated Ender Pearls drops from Endermen killed in the End"]
	quest.65629DC2B5889564.title: "Breeze Rod"
	quest.658944FFE86C7DD8.quest_desc: ["Oxidizing Activation Essence turns it into a gas. However, there is a lot of background static in its raw form. It will need further processing before we use it."]
	quest.65B9042E42AF75CF.quest_desc: [
		"Dear Employee #971165,"
		""
		"You have proved to be a perfectly acceptable employee and have met our expectations roughly 60% of the time. We can really tell that you hold this company's values close to your heart."
		""
		"So it's time we give you an exclusive mission, for you have been chosen. One that has come from the very top, with the highest level of secrecy."
		""
		"Did you really think that what you've created was a random group of expensive items? No, of course they aren't. Everything you've made, while they do make us &o&la lot&r&r of money, has another purpose. Not one of economics, but one of research."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Your mission, now, is to create a machine. A machine with far greater capabilities than anything seen on Earth. One that can reach back through time, and see the very beginning of the universe, see the long-theorised Cosmic Currency."
		""
		"If we can prove the existence of this elusive item, we can prove the very foundation of the world we live in is built on money, and by extension, capitalism. With this, we can prove that it is in fact perfectly fine for us to be storing 5 quintillion bucks for our own safekeeping, away from the \"morals\" of those who are too lazy to work for what they want."
		""
		"Good luck, Employee #971165."
		""
		"Signed,"
		"Opolis Inc. CEO B. Benlaw and COO E. Zoro"
	]
	quest.65BB600D5B471CAA.quest_desc: [
		"As part of your signing bonus, you have been fitted with an Opolis Inc. Augmented Ultiminer Chip. Hold the keybind to activate it, and dig away!"
		""
		"They'd have killed for this back in the gold rush."
	]
