	quest.70F2BA6E07A00FAA.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations! You've successfully proven our theory, and shown that your dedication to this company is as high as it should be! Thank you for all you've done for us. Your contract is now complete, so long as you've had your contractually-mandated fun! You are free to go, or continue working. Your choice."
		""
		"Now, in other news, there was a strange signal that came through during the computation process that you may have heard. We don't know where it came from, but it seems to have embedded itself within the Cosmic Currency, if you'd like to analyse it further."
	]
	quest.70F2BA6E07A00FAA.title: "Well done, Employee #971165"
	quest.710BDF883FB574AD.quest_desc: ["Used to make trades across spacetime."]
	quest.710BDF883FB574AD.quest_subtitle: "Made from Interdimensional Transactors"
	quest.71724E7007F72BE5.quest_desc: ["The Solar Neutron Activator can be used to transform chemicals using the sun as power."]
	quest.71724E7007F72BE5.quest_subtitle: "Kinda..."
	quest.71724E7007F72BE5.title: "Solar Power!"
	quest.719014BC6E32D93D.quest_desc: ["bigger crops and plants?"]
	quest.71D59895A2536322.quest_desc: [
		"Please note that by opening this message, you have signed a contract that states you will continue to work for and be employed by Opolis Inc. until all tasks contained with this document, hereby referred to as the \"Quest Book\", are completed. You also agree to release Opolis Inc. of all liability for any and all damage that may occur during your tenure, up to and including your untimely death."
		""
		"Thank you for choosing Opolis Inc. and we hope you enjoy your time with us! Remember, efficiency first."
	]
	quest.71D59895A2536322.title: "Legal Mumbo Jumbo"
	quest.720CBDE4D0F34D5B.title: "Unbreakable Elite Bounty License"
	quest.72145250E2C6518F.title: "Signalum"
	quest.723D2DFD3C04F993.quest_desc: ["Used to move power from place to place"]
	quest.729683BCAE8162FD.quest_desc: ["Brought to you from the creators of \"Punch Tree, Get Wood\""]
	quest.729683BCAE8162FD.title: "Logs"
	quest.72C96279B2DE4446.title: "Reality Undone"
	quest.72CB924ABE508C6C.quest_desc: [
		"Opolis Inc. employees are encouraged to keep in mind where they leave their belongings. However, we recognise that they are only human and are prone to human errors such as forgetfulness, so we have provided an Opolis Inc. Filtered Item PositioN Detector, also known as F.I.N.D.. Press \"Y\" on an item and the F.I.N.D will show nearby storage blocks that contain that item."
		""
		"Overuse of this device may lead to referral to our psychiatrists for possible early onset dementia."
	]
