	quest.737B28F09C4B211F.quest_desc: ["Villagers will level up as you trade. At max level, Shepherds, Carpenters and Masons will offer this."]
	quest.741B9E8DA175CB55.title: "Unbreakable Basic Storage License"
	quest.7473FC1BC15A4BA3.title: "Spider Eye"
	quest.7481FF23EFC4EDD0.title: "Unbreakable Advanced Processing License"
	quest.74CDD85558E1A976.quest_desc: ["basic mining materials"]
	quest.74D5A2BB6858DBCF.title: "Ghast Tear"
	quest.74DA5ACCDD97CD63.quest_desc: ["And there you have it, Opolisite, the most powerful alloy ever created! It will provide a very powerful base to high-end electronics."]
	quest.74DA5ACCDD97CD63.quest_subtitle: "The perfect alloy"
	quest.74DA5ACCDD97CD63.title: "Opolisite"
	quest.74EFACD051BCB09A.quest_desc: ["Piglins will provide receipts when you complete a trade. However, they don't always give you one. The guys in Accounting say it's tax evasion but they insist it's just \"occasional casual trades between friends\"."]
	quest.750E3B4C2196EEA1.title: "Activated Ender Pearl"
	quest.75E3A3764D1DE51E.quest_desc: ["Signalum is an alloy made from Copper, Silver and Redstone."]
	quest.765424007AEB1FE2.quest_desc: ["The Awakening Altar is an alternate version of the Infusion Altar, used to create more powerful or complex items using larger amounts of ingredients. "]
	quest.765424007AEB1FE2.title: "The Awakening Altar"
	quest.765B13B54586B316.quest_desc: [
		"Are you tired of your licenses asking for things you don't have? Do you wish you could sell all your beloved Cobblestone in peace? Well worry no longer, dear Employee, because the future of License Technology is here!"
		""
		"Introducing, the Specialized License! With this wonder of the free market in your hands, all of your worries will fade away. Watch as the orders stop pestering you for unnecessary items and fall into an unfaltering pattern. Doesn't that sound great?"
		""
		"But, it'll cost you! This technology is expensive, so we need to know you have the supply to keep up. Simply gift us a large down payment, and we'll grant you a license specialized for that item so you can sell more and more, &lfree of charge&r!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&oSpecialized Licenses subject to availability. Offer lasts for the next 30 seconds. Terms and Conditions apply.&r"
	]
	quest.765B13B54586B316.title: "Specialise Today!"
	quest.76F2626A0A44FD0A.quest_desc: ["Putting Noisy Activation Essence through a Chemical Washer alongside Liquid Null clears the background static and leaves you with Filtered Activation Essence."]
	quest.76FE92675A390765.quest_desc: ["Can be sold in the market"]
	quest.784C48A1CC79199D.quest_desc: [
		"Mixing your alloys together will create Inert Opolisite. This alloy was first theorised by Opolis Inc. COO E. Zoro and first synthesised by Opolis Inc. Founder and CEO B. Benlaw. It was heralded as \"the perfect alloy\", and was what put Opolis Inc. on the map. It has been used to create everything from perfectly stable construction to inpenetrable radiation shielding."
		""
		"However, there's still a few more steps before it can be used in that way. The alloying process massively increases the energy capacity of each of the metals used to make it. This renders it effectively inert despite the large amount of activation energy that it already contains. You'll need something much more powerful to fill it up."
	]
	quest.78542DD57A94AADB.quest_desc: [
		"We aren't entirely sure how the Shattered Singularity is possible, but it's somehow more compatible with ordinary matter than a regular Singularity."
		""
		"We would like to take this time to remind you that Opolis Inc. holds no liability for any damages caused to you or your personal belongings while you are working."
	]
	quest.78542DD57A94AADB.title: "Matter that Shouldn't Exist"
	quest.788336FE241C1FBC.quest_desc: ["Drops from clay blocks"]
